14. Termination
These Terms of Service are effective until terminated. Travelers may terminate these Terms of Service and/or suspend or terminate your access to or use of the Online Properties, in whole or in part, at any time and without prior notice, including if Travelers believes that you have violated or acted inconsistently with the letter or spirit of these Terms of Service. Upon any such termination or suspension, your right to use the Online Properties will immediately cease, and Travelers may, without liability to you or any third party, immediately and temporarily or permanently deactivate or delete your user name, password and/or account, and all associated materials, in each case without any obligation to provide any further access thereto. Sections 1–10 and 12–20 shall survive any expiration or termination of these Terms of Service.
